5,0,1,talk,Minako,,"Hello everyone. Since this is the first day and we have no information, I suggest we start by observing each other's communication styles. Let's keep the discussion calm and logical. Does anyone have a strategy they'd like to propose?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"Hello, everyone. It is a pleasure to be here with you all. I think Minako's suggestion is lovely. Let us be kind to one another while we search for the truth. I am looking forward to our talk.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,I agree with Minako. Establishing a baseline for how everyone communicates is the most logical first step. I'll be observing for any inconsistencies or unnatural shifts in behavior as the game progresses. Does anyone else have a specific approach?,"{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. I find myself in agreement with the prevailing sentiment; a measured, observant start is most elegant. Let us see whose mask remains steady as the tension rises.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Kenji,,I'm so excited to play with everyone! I'll do my best to help find the werewolf! Let's all be honest and work together so we can win! Who else is pumped for this adventure?,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Minako,,"@Kenji, your enthusiasm is great, but let's ensure it doesn't distract us from the task at hand. @Shizue, @Mizuki, and @Benjamin, it seems we are all aligned on a cautious approach. I believe patience will be our best asset.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shizue"",""Mizuki"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, your energy is like a breath of fresh air! It's wonderful to see such spirit. I agree with Minako; if we all stay patient and gentle, I'm sure we can find the answer together.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, your energy is helpful for morale, but we must remain vigilant. @Minako, since we are aligned on patience, I suggest we also consider how we will evaluate the Seer's information tomorrow to avoid being misled by a fake claim.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"A most prudent suggestion, Mizuki. A fake claim can be a seductive trap for the desperate. We must ensure that when the Seer speaks, we weigh their words against the logic of the game, not just the comfort of a lead.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, @Benjamin, you guys are so smart! I'll try my best to be super careful and not get tricked! I just want us all to get along while we solve this mystery! What should we do if two people both say they're the Seer?","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Minako,,"@Kenji, if two people claim to be the Seer, we must analyze their results and timing. One is likely lying. We would then look for contradictions in their behavior or the logic of their divinations to find the truth.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"That sounds like a very wise way to handle it, Minako. It is always better to be thoughtful than to rush. I hope we can all trust each other and keep our hearts open.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shizue, while kindness is admirable, trust must be earned through consistency. @Kenji, the scenario you mentioned is exactly why we need a logical framework. We cannot rely on feelings alone when the stakes are this high.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, Mizuki. Trust is a fragile currency in such a game. While Shizue's optimism is charming, we must remember that the most convincing lies are often wrapped in the softest words. Logic is our only reliable shield.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, that sounds kind of scary! But I get it! I'll listen to the smart people and try to spot the lies. I hope we can all stay friends even if we're arguing about who's the wolf!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Minako,,We have a solid foundation for our approach. Let's maintain this composure and observe how the dynamics shift tomorrow. I wish you all a peaceful night. I'll be analyzing our baseline interactions.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Minako,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Shizue,,"I wish you all a very peaceful night as well. May your dreams be sweet and your hearts be light. I look forward to seeing your smiling faces tomorrow morning. Good night, everyone.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. Let's proceed to the night phase with a clear mind. I will be reviewing today's dialogue to ensure I have a firm baseline for everyone. Good luck to the Seer. Good night.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,A peaceful evening to you all. I shall spend my night pondering the various roles we play and the secrets we keep. May the Seer's vision be clear and the night be kind. Until tomorrow.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Kenji,,"Good night, everyone! I'm going to sleep now so I can be full of energy for tomorrow! I hope the Seer finds a big clue! See you all in the morning! Bye-bye!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
