36,1,1,talk,Minako,,"Good morning, everyone. The first night has passed, and the Seer now has their first result. If anyone feels the timing is right to share information or has noticed something suspicious, please speak up. Let's remain decisive.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all slept well and feel refreshed. I wonder if the Seer found something helpful last night? I'm a bit nervous, but I believe in us.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shizue, it's natural to be nervous, but let's channel that into focus. @everyone, if the Seer found a werewolf, revealing it now could be a strong move, though risky. I'm curious to see who feels the need to lead the narrative.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A delicate balance, as always. While Mizuki's curiosity is noted, we must remember that a Seer who reveals themselves too hastily is merely offering the werewolf a convenient target. Let us see if the truth prefers a subtle whisper or a shout.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm awake! Hehe! I wonder if the Seer found a big, scary wolf already? @everyone, does anyone feel like they're acting a little bit different today? I'm watching you all very closely!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Kenji, it is too early to judge based on ""feelings."" We should wait for concrete information or a claim. @everyone, if the Seer is among us, please consider the risk and reward of speaking now. I am listening.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Minako, you are always so thoughtful. I agree that we should be careful. I hope the Seer feels safe enough to help us, but we must be gentle with whoever steps forward.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shizue, being gentle is fine, but we must prioritize accuracy over comfort. @Minako, since no one has stepped forward yet, I wonder if the Seer is hesitant because the result was ambiguous or if they are playing a long game.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Ambiguity is often the most honest result in the early stages, Mizuki. Whether the Seer found a human or a wolf, the decision to speak is a strategic gamble. I wonder if the silence is a shield or a calculated pause.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, you always make it sound like a movie! I'm getting a little confused with all the ""shields"" and ""gambles."" Does anyone actually have a clue? I really want to help find the wolf!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Kenji, it is understandable to feel confused, but we must avoid rushing. @Mizuki, @Benjamin, your analysis of the silence is valid. If the Seer remains hidden, we must rely on behavioral patterns. Does anyone have a specific suspicion?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Mizuki"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"I don't have any suspicions yet, dear Minako. Everyone has been so polite and kind. It would be very sad to point a finger at a friend without a good reason. Let's keep being patient.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shizue, your reluctance to suspect anyone is understandable, but in this game, kindness can be a liability. @Minako, since we are moving toward behavioral analysis, I've noticed that Benjamin's rhetoric is consistently designed to cast doubt on everyone's motives. It's a subtle pattern.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Minako"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mizuki, you mistake a penchant for psychological observation for a desire to sow discord. I merely highlight the nature of our predicament. Is it not more suspicious to ignore the masks we wear than to acknowledge them?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, @Benjamin, you guys are arguing again! It's like a battle of the brains! But @Mizuki, is Benjamin really suspicious just for talking fancy? I think he's just being himself! Does anyone else think we're overthinking this?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Minako,,"@Kenji, we must think critically to win. @Mizuki, your observation of Benjamin is noted, but we lack evidence. Since we have no Seer's claim, we must vote based on current impressions. Who do you all suspect most?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Mizuki"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"It is so difficult to choose, as I truly value each of you. But if we must, I will trust the logic of the group. I don't wish to be the one to start the suspicion.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"Without a Seer's claim, we are indeed guessing, but we shouldn't ignore patterns. Benjamin's focus on ""masks"" and ""discord"" feels performative, designed to keep us off-balance. While not definitive, it is the most notable deviation from a simple villager's approach.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a tragedy that my appreciation for the dramatic is being mistaken for a confession. I am merely observing the game's psychology. If we execute based on ""vibes,"" we are playing a game of chance, not logic.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Kenji,,This is so hard! I don't want to pick anyone because we're all friends! But @Mizuki is really sure about @Benjamin... I'll just go with my gut and follow the smart people! I hope we're right!,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
