68,2,1,talk,Minako,,"Benjamin was executed, but Mizuki was attacked. This suggests the werewolf viewed Mizuki as a threat or a high-value target. Since Benjamin is gone, we must re-evaluate. Does anyone have a divination result to share now?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"Oh dear, it is such a tragedy to lose both Benjamin and Mizuki so quickly. My heart is heavy. I hope the Seer is still with us and can guide us safely through this sadness.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"Wait, Mizuki is gone too?! This is getting really scary! I can't believe it! @Minako, you're right, the wolf must have been really afraid of Mizuki. Does that mean the Seer is still here? Please tell us if you are!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Kenji, panic will not help us. We are now down to three players. If the Seer is still alive, the risk of staying silent far outweighs the risk of being targeted. @Shizue, do you have any information to share?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"I am not the Seer, dear Minako. I only wish we could all be safe. It is so frightening to think that one of us is the wolf while we are all trying so hard to be friends.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Minako, @Shizue, if neither of you is the Seer, then the Seer must be gone! That's so sad! Now it's just us three, and one of us is the wolf! I'm really scared now... who do you think it is?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,3,talk,Minako,,"@Kenji, let's stay focused. If the Seer is dead, we must rely on the facts. Shizue, you've been very gentle, but your reluctance to suspect anyone is a convenient cover. Between you and Kenji, who is more likely the wolf?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Minako, that is a very scary question. I only wish to be kind to everyone. I am just a simple old woman who hopes we can all get along. Do you truly think my kindness is a mask?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Minako, that's not fair! Why are you asking that? @Shizue is just being nice! I'm just a kid, I couldn't be the wolf! I'm too scared! Maybe the wolf is the one asking all the scary questions?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,4,talk,Minako,,"@Kenji, asking questions is how we find the truth. If I were the werewolf, I would likely be trying to deflect suspicion or play the victim, not pushing for a logical conclusion. @Shizue, your kindness is noted, but it provides no evidence of your role.","{""words"":45,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"I understand your position, Minako. It is a sad thing that my nature is seen as a lack of evidence. I only hope that we can find the truth without losing our hearts to suspicion. I trust you both.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Minako, you're being way too mean to @Shizue! She's just being sweet! If you're the wolf, you're just trying to make us fight so you can win! I don't want to pick, but you're acting really suspicious right now!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
